		{"id":"1f1a487a885883b6","type":"text","text":"**General Ledger (GL)**\n\n|gl_entry_id|posting_date|account_id|debit_amount|credit_amount|currency|cost_center|business_unit|document_id|\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|GL001|2024-01-15|5010|10000|0|INR|HR|India|DOC123|\n|GL002|2024-01-15|1010|0|10000|INR|HR|India|DOC123|\n|GL003|2024-01-20|4010|0|50000|INR|Sales|India|DOC456|","x":-782,"y":309,"width":1082,"height":251},
