		{"id":"db5b99ee37479e63","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n\nA[Chart of Accounts]\n\nA --> B{Balance Sheet}\nA --> C{Net Income}\n\n%% Balance Sheet\nB --> B1[Assets plus]\nB --> B2[Liabilities and Equity]\n\n%% Assets\nB1 --> B11[Current Assets]\nB1 --> B12[Non Current Assets]\n\nB11 --> B111[Bank]\nB11 --> B112[Accounts Receivable]\nB11 --> B113[Deferred Expense]\nB11 --> B114[Other Current Assets]\n\nB111 --> B1111[Bank Accounts 1001 to 1039 and 1090 to 1092]\nB112 --> B1121[Accounts Receivable 1100 to 1109]\nB113 --> B1131[Prepaid and Deposits 1200 to 1201]\nB114 --> B1141[Undeposited Funds 1099]\n\nB12 --> B121[Other Assets]\nB12 --> B122[Fixed Assets]\n\nB121 --> B1211[Investments 1300 to 1303]\nB121 --> B1212[Deferred and Capitalized Costs 1400 to 1503]\n\nB122 --> B1221[Land 1600]\nB122 --> B1222[Buildings net 1605 to 1705]\nB122 --> B1223[Equipment net 1610 to 1710]\nB122 --> B1224[Vehicles net 1615 to 1715]\nB122 --> B1225[Furniture and Fixtures net 1620 to 1720]\nB122 --> B1226[IT Assets net 1625 to 1725]\nB122 --> B1227[Leasehold Improvements net 1630 to 1730]\nB122 --> B1228[Construction in Progress 1695]\nB122 --> B1229[Fixed Asset Clearing 1699]\n\n%% Liabilities and Equity\nB2 --> B21[Liabilities]\nB2 --> B22[Equity]\n\nB21 --> B211[Current Liabilities]\nB21 --> B212[Long Term Liabilities]\n\nB211 --> B2111[Accounts Payable 2000]\nB211 --> B2112[Credit Cards 2150]\nB211 --> B2113[Other Current Liabilities 2001 to 2109]\nB211 --> B2114[Deferred Revenue 2200 to 2219]\n\nB212 --> B2121[Lease Liabilities 2300]\nB212 --> B2122[Retirement and SERP 2301 to 2302]\nB212 --> B2123[Loans and Settlements 2303 to 2306]\nB212 --> B2124[Deferred Compensation 2307 to 2308]\n\nB22 --> B221[Contributed Capital 3000]\nB22 --> B222[Undistributed Earnings 3002]\nB22 --> B223[Partner Distributions 3003]\nB22 --> B224[Members Equity 3004 to 3006 and 3009]\nB22 --> B225[Retained Earnings 3001 3007 3008]\n\n%% Net Income\nC --> C1[Revenue]\nC --> C2[Expenses]\nC --> C3[Other Income and Expense]\n\n%% Revenue\nC1 --> C11[Ticket Revenue 4000 to 4050]\nC1 --> C12[Sponsorship Revenue 4100 to 4120]\nC1 --> C13[Food and Beverage 4200 to 4250]\nC1 --> C14[Merchandise 4300 to 4350]\nC1 --> C15[Parking 4400 to 4405]\nC1 --> C16[Broadcast 4500 to 4515]\nC1 --> C17[NFL Revenue 4600 to 4640]\nC1 --> C18[Event Revenue 4700 to 4720]\nC1 --> C19[Cheerleaders 4800 to 4805]\nC1 --> C110[Other Revenue 4900 to 4935]\nC1 --> C111[Foundation Contributions 4950 to 4970]\n\n%% Expenses\nC2 --> C21[Salaries and Benefits]\nC2 --> C22[Operating Expenses]\n\nC21 --> C211[Player Salaries 5000 to 5049]\nC21 --> C212[Staff Salaries 5050 to 5069]\nC21 --> C213[Benefits 5071 to 5099]\n\nC22 --> C221[Travel and Entertainment 5100 to 5199]\nC22 --> C222[Supplies and Services 5200 to 5299]\nC22 --> C223[Football Operations 5300 to 5399]\nC22 --> C224[Stadium and Facilities 5400 to 5499]\nC22 --> C225[Sales and Marketing 5500 to 5599]\nC22 --> C226[Foundation 5600 to 5699]\nC22 --> C227[Taxes and Insurance 5700 to 5799]\nC22 --> C228[League Assessments 5800 to 5899]\nC22 --> C229[Other Expense 5900 to 5999]\nC22 --> C2210[Depreciation 6200]\nC22 --> C2211[Amortization 6300 to 6305]\n\n%% Other Income and Expense\nC3 --> C31[Net Interest 6100 to 6105]\nC3 --> C32[Gain or Loss on Sale 6400 to 6405]\n\n\n```","x":-637,"y":1553,"width":14317,"height":2027},
		{"id":"c80134474fd97f93","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\n\nflowchart TD\n\nA[Chart of Accounts]\nA --> B{Financial Statement}\n\nB --> B1[Balance Sheet]\nB --> B2[Net Income]\n\n%% =====================\n%% Balance Sheet\n%% =====================\n\nB1 --> C{Balance Sheet Category}\n\nC --> C1[Assets]\nC1 --> C11{Asset Type}\n\nC11 --> C111[Current Assets]\nC111 --> C1111{Current Asset Category}\n\nC1111 --> C11111[Bank]\nC11111 --> C111111[Bank Accounts 1001 to 1039 and 1090 to 1092]\n\nC1111 --> C11112[Accounts Receivable]\nC11112 --> C111121[Accounts Receivable 1100 to 1109]\n\nC1111 --> C11113[Deferred Expense]\nC11113 --> C111131[Prepaid and Deposits 1200 to 1201]\n\nC1111 --> C11114[Other Current Assets]\nC11114 --> C111141[Undeposited Funds 1099]\n\nC11 --> C112[Non Current Assets]\nC112 --> C1121{Non Current Asset Category}\n\nC1121 --> C11211[Other Assets]\nC11211 --> C112111[Investments and Deferred Assets 1300 to 1503]\n\nC1121 --> C11212[Fixed Assets]\nC11212 --> C112121[Land Buildings Equipment Vehicles Furniture IT Assets Leasehold Improvements CIP Clearing 1600 to 1730 and 1695 and 1699]\n\n%% =====================\n%% Liabilities and Equity\n%% =====================\n\nB1 --> D{Liabilities and Equity Category}\n\nD --> D1[Liabilities]\nD1 --> D11{Liability Term}\n\nD11 --> D111[Current Liabilities]\nD111 --> D1111[Accounts Payable Credit Cards Other Current Liabilities Deferred Revenue 2000 to 2219]\n\nD11 --> D112[Long Term Liabilities]\nD112 --> D1121[Lease Retirement Loans Deferred Compensation 2300 to 2308]\n\nD --> D2[Equity]\nD2 --> D21[Capital and Retained Earnings 3000 to 3009]\n\n%% =====================\n%% Net Income\n%% =====================\n\nB2 --> E{Net Income Category}\n\nE --> E1[Revenue]\nE1 --> E11{Revenue Type}\n\nE11 --> E111[Ticket Sponsorship Food Beverage Merchandise Parking Broadcast NFL Event Other Foundation Revenue 4000 to 4970]\n\nE --> E2[Expenses]\nE2 --> E21{Expense Type}\n\nE21 --> E211[Salaries and Benefits 5000 to 5099]\nE21 --> E212[Operating Expenses 5100 to 6305]\n\nE --> E3[Other Income and Expense]\nE3 --> E31[Interest and Gain Loss 6100 to 6405]\n\n```","x":-867,"y":3995,"width":4027,"height":2385},
		{"id":"fc35d227ab5483c5","type":"text","text":"Chart of Accounts\n├── Balance Sheet\n│   ├── Assets (+)\n│   │   ├── Current Assets (+)\n│   │   │   ├── Bank (+)\n│   │   │   │   ├── 1001–1039, 1090–1092  → Bank Accounts\n│   │   │   ├── Accounts Receivable (+)\n│   │   │   │   ├── 1100–1109 → AR / Allowances / Notes\n│   │   │   ├── Deferred Expense (+)\n│   │   │   │   ├── 1200 Prepaid\n│   │   │   │   ├── 1201 Deposits\n│   │   │   └── Other Current Asset (+)\n│   │   │       └── 1099 Undeposited Funds\n│   │   └── Non-Current Assets (+)\n│   │       ├── Other Asset (+)\n│   │       │   ├── Investments (1300–1303)\n│   │       │   ├── Deferred / Capitalized Costs (1400–1503)\n│   │       └── Fixed Assets (+)\n│   │           ├── Land (1600)\n│   │           ├── Building, net (1605 – 1705)\n│   │           ├── Equipment, net (1610 – 1710)\n│   │           ├── Vehicles, net (1615 – 1715)\n│   │           ├── Furniture & Fixtures, net (1620 – 1720)\n│   │           ├── IT Assets, net (1625 – 1725)\n│   │           ├── Leasehold Improvements, net (1630 – 1730)\n│   │           ├── CIP (1695)\n│   │           └── FA Clearing (1699)\n│   │\n│   └── Liabilities and Equity\n│       ├── Liabilities (−)\n│       │   ├── Current Liabilities (+)\n│       │   │   ├── Accounts Payable (2000)\n│       │   │   ├── Credit Cards (2150)\n│       │   │   ├── Other Current Liabilities (2001–2109)\n│       │   │   └── Deferred Revenue (2200–2219)\n│       │   └── Long-Term Liabilities (+)\n│       │       ├── Lease Liabilities (2300)\n│       │       ├── Retirement / SERP (2301–2302)\n│       │       ├── Loans & Settlements (2303–2306)\n│       │       └── Deferred Compensation (2307–2308)\n│       │\n│       └── Equity (−)\n│           ├── Contributed Capital (3000)\n│           ├── Undistributed Earnings (3002)\n│           ├── Partner Distributions (3003)\n│           ├── Member’s Equity (3004–3006, 3009)\n│           └── Retained Earnings\n│               ├── Current Year\n│               ├── Prior Year\n│               └── Comprehensive Income (3001, 3007–3008)\n│\n└── Net Income\n    ├── Revenue (+)\n    │   ├── Ticket Revenue (4000–4050)\n    │   ├── Sponsorship Revenue (4100–4120)\n    │   ├── Food & Beverage (4200–4250)\n    │   ├── Merchandise (4300–4350)\n    │   ├── Parking (4400–4405)\n    │   ├── Broadcast (4500–4515)\n    │   ├── NFL Revenue (4600–4640)\n    │   ├── Event Revenue (4700–4720)\n    │   ├── Cheerleaders (4800–4805)\n    │   ├── Other Revenue (4900–4935)\n    │   └── Foundation Contributions (4950–4970)\n    │\n    ├── Expenses (−)\n    │   ├── Salaries & Benefits\n    │   │   ├── Player Salaries (5000–5049)\n    │   │   ├── Staff Salaries (5050–5069)\n    │   │   └── Benefits (5071–5099)\n    │   └── Operating Expenses\n    │       ├── Travel & Entertainment (5100–5199)\n    │       ├── Supplies & Services (5200–5299)\n    │       ├── Football Ops (5300–5399)\n    │       ├── Stadium & Facilities (5400–5499)\n    │       ├── Sales & Marketing (5500–5599)\n    │       ├── Foundation (5600–5699)\n    │       ├── Taxes & Insurance (5700–5799)\n    │       ├── League Assessments (5800–5899)\n    │       ├── Other Expense (5900–5999)\n    │       ├── Depreciation (6200)\n    │       └── Amortization (6300–6305)\n    │\n    └── Other Income & Expense\n        ├── Net Interest (6100–6105)\n        └── Gain / Loss on Sale (6400–6405)\n","x":608,"y":6555,"width":972,"height":2805},
		{"id":"1a4dd95f54340ce9","type":"text","text":"Business Event\n   ↓\nJournal Entry (Debit / Credit)\n   ↓\nChart of Accounts\n   ↓\nTrial Balance\n   ↓\nFinancial Statements\n   ↓\nClose Adjustments\n   ↓\nFP&A Analysis\n   ↓\nForecast / Budget\n   ↓\nBusiness Decisions\n   ↓\nBusiness Event (again)\n","x":1720,"y":6555,"width":589,"height":540},
