		{"id":"3d255a32b318d856","type":"text","text":"**Conceptual Ontology**\n\n1. Industry type - Accounting \n2. Some business Context\n\n3. Ontology concepts & alias\n\t1. Business entities\n\t\t1. GL\n\t\t\t1. Key business fields\n\t\t\t2. alias\n\t\n\t2. Dq rules\n\t3. Data products\n4. Ontology Relationships\n5. Ontology Bindings\n","x":-600,"y":9320,"width":450,"height":400},
