		{"id":"8054a5b1be33aa0c","type":"text","text":"Landed Files","x":-342,"y":10155,"width":134,"height":50},
		{"id":"87ecc22eeab2b6ff","type":"text","text":"1. Meta Ontology\n\t1. GL - Business entity\n\t\t1. Efficient RAG query to match the physical table\n\t\t2. K=2\n\t\t3. Threshold >0.8\n\t\t4. GL - Ontology concept\n\t\t\t1. Ontology binding\n\t\t\t\t1. Actuals\n\t\t\t\t\t1. COA\n\t\t\t\t\t2. TB\n\t\t5. TB\n\t\t\t1. COA\n\t\t\t2. GL\n\t\t6. COA\n\t\t\t1. GL\n\t\t\t2. TB","x":30,"y":9000,"width":410,"height":480},
		{"id":"7aad5d593ff2ddad","type":"text","text":"The sample General Ledger table serves as a critical component of the financial data structure within an accounting system, capturing detailed transactional activities associated with various accounts. It includes essential fields such as account description, account number, account type, and monetary amounts in both local and foreign currencies. \n\nThis table plays a vital role in financial statement preparation, reconciliation, and audits by providing a comprehensive view of financial transactions over specified periods. Key relationships include its connection to the Chart of Accounts, which defines the account structure, and the Trial Balance, which summarizes account-level balances. \n\nThe table supports data validation processes to ensure compliance with accounting standards and maintain data integrity across financial reporting.","x":1540,"y":9920,"width":780,"height":437},
		{"id":"85f393f5e41e4f72","type":"text","text":"  \"embedding_input\": \"\n  \n  [IDENTITY] dim.coa_hierarchy_format_in.meta_testing_115 | Dimension Identifier in Chart of Accounts | Financial Planning & Analysis Finance | aka: dimension, dim_id\\n\\n\n  \n  [SEMANTICS] Unique identifier for account dimensions used in financial reporting | Values: integer identifiers | Rules: must be unique; cannot be null | Dependencies: None\\n\\n\n  \n  [TECHNICAL] INTEGER(10) NOT NULL | PK | Format: ^[0-9]+$\",\n","x":1540,"y":10440,"width":780,"height":432},
		{"id":"f3a3875a28d9ba53","type":"text","text":"**Edge Cases**\n\n1. Address - Business entity\n\t1. Binded to \n\t\t1. Addr 1, 2, 3, 4, state\n2. DQ rule\n\t1. Bind to business fields\n\t\t1. Tables and Columns","x":1240,"y":9420,"width":386,"height":240},
		{"id":"087898705c789f7d","type":"text","text":"**Metadata Inference** ( Future State)\n\n1. Flattening- Make Parquet format\n2. Basic Profiling\n\t1. \n3. Meta Inference\n\t1. At a table level \n\t\n\t\t1. Stage 1 - \n\t\t\t1. Infer Description\n\t\t\t\t1. Meta columns\n\t\t\t\t2. Sample data\n\t\t\t2. Semantics\n\t\t\t\t1. embeddings ( There is not pattern)\n\t\t\t\t\t1. Identity\n\t\t\t\t\t2. Semantic\n\t\t\t\t\t3. Tech Description\n\t\t\t3. Embeddings\n\t\t\t4. Ontology Binding as a separate process ( From Conceptual Ontoligy to Physical )\n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t5. Integrity inferences\n\t\t\t\t1. Foreign Keys for this table\n\t\t\t\t2. Make edges with the columns\n\t\t\t\t3. Self RAG\n\t\t\t\t\t1. Adding Binded ontology\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t","x":640,"y":9780,"width":578,"height":640},
		{"id":"d20d05b09c9c30e9","type":"text","text":"data product --> SQL --> LLM ( Context )\n\n- Tables\n- Columns\n- Source\n\n- User query\n\t- Dq or metric\n\t\t- Table and Columns - ?\n\t\t\t- LLM \n\t\t\t\t- SQL\n\t\t\t\t\t- Verify \n\t\t\t\t\t\t- Execute","x":-523,"y":8720,"width":403,"height":420},
		{"id":"0ca3e809117125a6","type":"text","text":"DQ Agent ( Current State )\n\n- User query\n- Build context\n\t- Get DQ Concept\n\t- Get table metadata with DQ concept\n\t- Get column metadata with above context\n\t- Get external context with above context\n- Make SQL with above context\n","x":-709,"y":10335,"width":434,"height":325},
		{"id":"c123598c91f5f9c5","type":"text","text":"DQ Agent ( Future State )\n\n- User query\n- Build context\n\t- Get DQ Concept or make Concept\n\t- Get table metadata with DQ concept - via binding \n\t- Get table metadata with DQ concept - via binding \n\t- Get column metadata with above context\n\t- Get external context with above context\n- Make SQL with above context","x":-709,"y":10760,"width":434,"height":340},
