		{"id":"4c01c99e556c1a98","type":"text","text":"**DQ Agent** \n\n1. Input - user query\n2. **Context** \n\t1. Matching concept\n\t\t1. if matchin concept is not found, then make one.\n\t\t2. Make async call to build new concept.\n\t2. For the matching concept, get matching actual/Physica RAG on table.\n\t\t1. If matching table not found, tell user, I didn't matching actual. Can you help me find, if not found.\n\t3. For the matching concept, get matching actual/Physica RAG on column.\n\t\t1. If matching table not found, tell user, I didn't matching actual. Can you help me find, if not found.\n\t4. JSON\n\t5. Binding","x":-249,"y":13130,"width":659,"height":450},
		{"id":"1e723599664f6209","type":"text","text":"\"formula\": {  \n    \"calculation_order\": 4,  \n    \"expression\": \"Net Income = (Total Revenue - Total Expenses)\",  \n    \"name\": \"Net Income\",  \n    \"description\": \"The total profit of the company after all expenses have been deducted from total revenue.\",  \n    \"related_components\": [  \n      \"Total Revenue\",  \n      \"Total Expenses\"  \n    ],  \n    \"fields\": [  \n      {  \n        \"calculation_order\": 3,  \n        \"name\": \"Total Revenue\",  \n        \"description\": \"The total income generated from sales before any expenses are deducted.\",  \n        \"expression\": \"Total Revenue = SUM(total_revenue)\",  \n        \"related_components\": [  \n          \"total_revenue\"  \n        ],  \n        \"fields\": [  \n          {  \n            \"calculation_order\": 1,  \n            \"name\": \"total_revenue\",  \n            \"description\": \"Total revenue from all sales.\",  \n            \"expression\": \"total_revenue = SUM(order_total_cents)\",  \n            \"related_components\": [],  \n            \"mapped_columns\": {  \n              \"table_id\": \"12c500ed0b7879105fb46af0f246be87\",  \n              \"table_name\": \"orders\",  \n              \"column_id\": \"b9bd27f8f4ddd2bfcc515d36bb948db7\",  \n              \"column_name\": \"order_total_cents\",  \n              \"source_id\": \"a3bce341-793a-4c77-b57f-33b60fc21e88\",  \n              \"source_name\": \"postgres_allfiles\",  \n              \"domain_id\": null,  \n              \"domain_name\": null,  \n              \"data_type\": \"Int\",  \n              \"confidence_score\": 0.85  \n            },  \n            \"mapping_status\": \"mapped\",  \n            \"calculated_value\": null  \n          }  \n        ]  \n      },  \n      {  \n        \"calculation_order\": 3,  \n        \"name\": \"Total Expenses\",  \n        \"description\": \"The total costs incurred by the company in generating revenue.\",  \n        \"expression\": \"Total Expenses = SUM(total_expenses)\",  \n        \"related_components\": [  \n          \"total_expenses\"  \n        ],  \n        \"fields\": [  \n          {  \n            \"calculation_order\": 1,  \n            \"name\": \"total_expenses\",  \n            \"description\": \"Total expenses incurred.\",  \n            \"expression\": \"total_expenses = SUM(line_total_cents)\",  \n            \"related_components\": [],  \n            \"mapped_columns\": {  \n              \"table_id\": \"e759f18f45d712ba4707babc1a13f9e9\",  \n              \"table_name\": \"order_items\",  \n              \"column_id\": \"ee05859ba3e3d7852058ad896a5b1fdb\",  \n              \"column_name\": \"line_total_cents\",  \n              \"source_id\": \"a3bce341-793a-4c77-b57f-33b60fc21e88\",  \n              \"source_name\": \"postgres_allfiles\",  \n              \"domain_id\": null,  \n              \"domain_name\": null,  \n              \"data_type\": \"Int\",  \n              \"confidence_score\": 0.85  \n            },  \n            \"mapping_status\": \"mapped\",  \n            \"calculated_value\": null  \n          }  \n        ]  \n      }  \n    ]  \n  },","x":577,"y":13037,"width":983,"height":1903},
		{"id":"f9c74c81927429a4","type":"text","text":"**Accounting Ontology**","x":-1100,"y":13934,"width":260,"height":386},
