		{"id":"1b56cf8f314d67b0","type":"text","text":"business_Context/Client_Context\n\n- industry_type\n- Ontology Templates\n\t- Accounting\n\t- Arts & Theatre","x":-1800,"y":13934,"width":302,"height":386},
		{"id":"3983921b80851b44","type":"text","text":"**Materialise** \n\nontology_concept    \n- id    \n- name              -- \"Customer\", \"Churn Rate\", \"Invoice\"    \n- kind              -- entity | metric | dimension | enum | dq_rule | process    \n- description       -- human-readable meaning    \n- domain            -- \"billing\", \"growth\", etc.    \n- is_primary        -- bool (true for canonical concepts)\n\n      ontology_concept_alias    \n      - id    \n      - concept_id    \n      - alias             -- \"client\", \"subscriber\", \"account\"    \n      - alias_type        -- synonym | legacy_name | external_system_name\n\n- embeddings - object + relationship +","x":-1840,"y":14549,"width":560,"height":488},
		{"id":"15333ddbda95a0fc","type":"text","text":"ontology_relation    \n- id    \n- from_concept_id    \n- to_concept_id    \n- relation_type     -- has_many | belongs_to | derived_from | equivalent_to | uses_metric | constrained_by | dq_checks    \n- description       -- \"Each Customer can have many Subscriptions\"","x":-1220,"y":15080,"width":374,"height":380},
		{"id":"33c5246ffc9cde7e","type":"text","text":"Physical ","x":-323,"y":14712,"width":323,"height":248},
		{"id":"1c1582a22082afd3","type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\nconcept_binding    \n- id    \n- concept_id    \n- data_object_id    -- pointer to table/column/metric in your schema catalog    \n- binding_type      -- primary_table | dimension_impl | metric_impl | fk_impl | source_system    \n- confidence_score  -- 0–1","x":-960,"y":14460,"width":480,"height":286,"color":"1"},
