		{"id":"eb6d9019b7043987","type":"text","text":"**Metadata Inference** \n\n1. Flattening- Make Parquet format\n2. Basic Profiling \n\n   \n3. Meta Inference\n\t1. At a table level \n\t\n\t\t1. Stage 1 - \n\t\t\t1. Infer Description\n\t\t\t\t1. Meta columns\n\t\t\t\t2. Sample data\n\t\t\t2. Semantics\n\t\t\t\t1. embeddings\n\t\t\t\t\t1. Identity\n\t\t\t\t\t2. Semantic\n\t\t\t\t\t3. Tech Description\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t3. Integrity inferences\n\t\t\t\t1. Foreign Keys for this table\n\t\t\t\t2. Make edges with the columns\n\t\t\n\t\t2. Stage 2 - \n\t\t\t1. RAG to get the relevant Concepts from Ontology using the table profile \n\t\t\t\t1. Add concept Id to Table/physical\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t2. Make the right RAG\n\t\t\t\t\t1. Ontology semantic should match RAG query from here.\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t3. Bind it with the ontology\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t","x":-54,"y":9663,"width":578,"height":757},
		{"id":"84dbad13baa84256","type":"text","text":"\t2. RAG to get the relevant Concepts from Ontology using the table profile \n\t\t\t1. Match with DQs Concepts\n\t\t\t2. Bind physical table with DQ Concepts\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t","x":-54,"y":10498,"width":578,"height":237},
		{"id":"b735024e17ecfbd1","type":"text","text":"Table Meta","x":1069,"y":10705,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6be7d6369139fc39","type":"text","text":"**Agents** - API Call\n- DQ\n\t- Logs\n\t\t- Step\n\t\t- RAG Query\n\t\t- Semantics\n\t\t\t- V1\n\t\t\t- V2\n- Metric\n\t- - Logs\n\t\t- Step\n\t\t- RAG Query\n\t\t- Semantics\n- Meta ( Workflow)\n\t- Logs\n- Add Knowledge/External Context\n\t- Please look into Mongo\n\n\t\n\t","x":1260,"y":10960,"width":300,"height":600},
